{"id": "68965", "title": "樯橹也怡情", "author": "了了是我", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 17, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68965.htm", "intro": "林怡情有一个梦想，老公，孩子，热炕头，有一个稳定工作，每天柴米油盐酱醋茶，平平淡淡过一生。\r\n褚樯橹有一个爱好，莺燕相伴，能上就上，不能上的创造条件也要上，每天温香软玉，娇喘盈盈只看今朝。\r\n\r\n当林怡情误撞褚樯橹，她百思不得其解，为什么这个男人竟然道德败坏到如此境界。\r\n\r\n感慨之时，她不由得想到了一句对联：\r\n上联：小撸怡情，大撸伤身，强撸灰飞烟灭。\r\n下联：先撕短裙，再撕短裤，百撕不得骑姐。\r\n\r\n内容标签：都市情缘 高干 天之骄子 强取豪夺", "base": "files/article/html/68/68965", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10552289.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-11", "file": "10552290.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12-17", "file": "10552291.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18-23", "file": "10552292.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24-29", "file": "10552293.html", "available": false}, {"title": "30-34", "file": "10552294.html", "available": false}, {"title": "35-38", "file": "10552295.html", "available": false}, {"title": "39-42", "file": "10552296.html", "available": false}, {"title": "43-46", "file": "10552297.html", "available": false}, {"title": "47-50", "file": "10552298.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-54", "file": "10552299.html", "available": false}, {"title": "55-59", "file": "10552300.html", "available": false}, {"title": "60-63", "file": "10552301.html", "available": false}, {"title": "64-68", "file": "10552302.html", "available": false}, {"title": "69-73", "file": "10552303.html", "available": false}, {"title": "74-78", "file": "10552304.html", "available": false}, {"title": "79-82完结", "file": "10552305.html", "available": false}]}